# Owner-local credentials: `task bunny:*` (apply, zone:apply, onboard, purge, gc) and the cutover audit.
# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in. Never set in CI: the tasks exit 1 when CI is set.
BUNNY_API_KEY=
# Read only by the Cloudflare steps of the cutover runbook (infra/cutover/README.md), never by a `bunny:*` task.
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
# This file holds live credentials: `chmod 600 .env`.
